      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "QUEEN FLOW (6) is a last start Grade 6 winner, jumping from this box and scoring by a neck over 300m at Murray Bridge. Has a very honest record from this same draw, including a win and two minors. Has the ability and looks hard to top. MAFIA MISTRESS (4) stalked the lead from a low draw and fought on well to finish 4 lengths back in third (17.25) at this track in a Grade 6 over 300m. Expected to feature. TOLEDO (1) goes very well this trip starting nine times for three wins and two minors. Below best last time at Murray Bridge (26.11) in a Grade 6, finishing a 4.5 lengths sixth. Looks suited here and can measure up. FLAMINGO GIRL (8) hit the frame here last start so don't underestimate.",
